<title>NETHERLANDS: GOUDA VUURVAST H1 NET UP 37 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>GOUDA VUURVAST H1 NET UP 37 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>GOUDA, Netherlands 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     3.2  vs   2.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				55.2  vs  47.8</p>
<p>    Operating costs		     50.3  vs  44.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     4.9  vs   3.6</p>
<p>    Cash flow				4.5  vs   3.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Gouda Vuurvast Holding NV said in March it expected</p>
<p>the 1996 first-half net to at least equal the 1995 figure.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
